        "created_at": "2014-09-09T10:47:33.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p><span class=\"bbcode-s\"> <strong>Advanced Cosmitron Round 8 begins</strong> </span></p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-s\"> Setting down my critical systems will not kill me, information can never truely die </span></p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-s\"> <strong>Cosmitron (21)</strong>&nbsp;Sentient Dropship </span></p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-s\"> <em>In Play:</em>&nbsp;Not a thing </span></p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-s\"> <em>Trash:</em>&nbsp;Terraforming, Disintegration Ray, Electro-magnetic Railgun, Electro-magnetic Railgun,Technological Singularity, Adaptive Plating Subroutine, Sedative Flechettes, Electropulse Explosive, Technological Singularity, Series 83 Assault Drone, Adaptive Plating, Series 83 Assault Drone, Interpolation Beam,&nbsp; Series 84 Automaton Drone,&nbsp;  Series 84 Automaton Drone,&nbsp;  Series 83 Assault Drone,&nbsp;  Series 85 Repair Drone,&nbsp;  Interpolation Beam, Disintegration Ray, Terraforming.  </span></p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-s\"> <em>Bottom of Deck:</em>&nbsp;Sedetive Fletchettes, Series 84 Automaton drone, EPE, Series 85 Repair Drone. </span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-s\"> <em>Start of turn:</em> Omnitron searches for components, finding none the Sentient Dropship stays around play. </span></p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-s\"> <em>Play:</em>&nbsp; Series 85 Repair Drone enters play, plays&nbsp;  Sedetive Fletchettes, which Parse discards with&nbsp;  Buffer Overflow (almost like she knows Omnitron inside and out), which plays a&nbsp;  Series 84 Automaton drone and an Electro-Pulse Explosive.</span></p>\n<p><em>End of turn:</em>&nbsp;Omnitron pew-pews \"people\". Tachyon takes 5 damage (8), Writhe would take 4 (5-Block) and redirects it to Cosmitron for 3 damage (18) Medico&nbsp;takes 4 (5-Block) damage (4), Repair drone heals Omnitron to (21), Writhe takes 5 (6-Block) damage (3) from Automatons</p>\n<hr>\n<p><b>End of Round 8 Villain Turn</b></p>\n<p><strong>Cosmitron (21)</strong>&nbsp;Sentient Dropship</p>\n<p><em>In Play:</em>&nbsp;Series 85 Repair Drone (4), Series 84 Automaton Drone (5), Electro-Pulse Explosive (15)</p>\n<p><em>Trash:</em> &nbsp;Terraforming, Disintegration Ray, Electro-magnetic Railgun, Electro-magnetic Railgun,Technological Singularity, Adaptive Plating Subroutine, Sedative Flechettes, Electropulse Explosive, Technological Singularity, Series 83 Assault Drone, Adaptive Plating, Series 83 Assault Drone, Interpolation Beam,&nbsp;  Series 84 Automaton Drone,&nbsp;  Series 84 Automaton Drone,&nbsp;  Series 83 Assault Drone,&nbsp;  Series 85 Repair Drone,&nbsp;  Interpolation Beam,&nbsp;  Disintegration Ray, Terraforming.</p>\n<p><em>Bottom of Deck:</em> &nbsp;Series 85 Repair Drone</p>\n<p><strong>Effects via Omnitron Cards</strong></p>\n<p>Damage dealt by Devices is increased by 1 (Advanced text), Omnitron gains Drones+1HP (Repair), Highest takes Drone's HP in energy damage, Start of turn all heroes take EPE's HP in Lightning damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Hero HP</strong></p>\n<p>K.N.Y.F.E. - 6</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Dr Medico - 4</li>\n<li>Mainstay &nbsp;- 7 </li>\n<li>The Idealist &nbsp;- 5&nbsp; </li>\n<li>Writhe &nbsp;- 4 </li>\n</ul>\nParse &nbsp;- 8 \n<p>Team Leader Tachyon &nbsp;- 8</p>\n<p>Setback &nbsp;- 8</p>\n<p><strong> K.N.Y.F.E. to start the last round </strong></p>",
